1
00:01:33,310 --> 00:01:34,979
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 16]

3
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,230
Qingyu,

4
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,640
you wanted to see me?

5
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:31,680
Three years ago,

6
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,650
you deliberately approached Qingyi,

7
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,400
framed him for murder,

8
00:02:38,079 --> 00:02:39,480
and caused the Huo family

9
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,680
to sever his hand tendons.

10
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:42,910
Today,

11
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,290
I want you to pay him back

12
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,660
for everything you did to him.

13
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,910
You cut the wrong place.

14
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,390
Why did you come back?

15
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:56,910
To continue deceiving Qingyi or me?

16
00:02:59,870 --> 00:03:01,400
I am indeed not Fang Mulan.

17
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,360
The real Fang Mulan

18
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,000
passed away long ago.

19
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,820
The Huo family killed her.

20
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:16,730
No wonder you won't let the Huo family go,

21
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,680
even at the cost of once again

22
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,470
putting Qingyi in fatal danger.

23
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:25,200
I never thought of hurting him!

24
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:27,710
But the Huo family

25
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:28,750
must die.

26
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,240
You've met Mr. Fang.

27
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:33,870
To him,

28
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:36,450
I am like his daughter.

29
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,710
And only I

30
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,200
can avenge his daughter.

31
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,910
No matter who I am,

32
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:44,400
the marriage alliance
between the Fang and Murong families

33
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,329
will not change.

34
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,840
At this point,

35
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,240
do you really think
I would still marry you?

36
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:53,950
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

37
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:55,310
If you kill me,

38
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:58,680
Qingyi will never forgive you.

39
00:04:06,150 --> 00:04:07,030
Killing you

40
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,280
would dirty my hands.

41
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,190
I will break off the engagement with you.

42
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:17,950
Once you step out of this door,

43
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:21,040
without the Murong family's protection,

44
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,430
in the vast Nancheng,

45
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,720
there are plenty of people
who want to kill you.

46
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:27,750
Now,

47
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,930
get out of the Murong family immediately.

48
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,430
Get out!

49
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,830
You mean

50
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:05,000
you want our family to help
the Huo family through this crisis?

51
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,480
Is there a problem?

52
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,310
You're dreaming.

53
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,800
Grandfather said that 12 years ago,

54
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:26,330
our two families
did something big together.

55
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,720
Grandfather also told me to pass on a message:

56
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,520
if you want to stand by and watch the Huo family die,

57
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:36,560
you'd better weigh the consequences.

58
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,510
Once this matter is exposed,

59
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:42,730
both our families will be ruined.

60
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,800
Taking someone down with us

61
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,420
wouldn't be a loss for the Huo family.

62
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,240
Also...

63
00:05:56,950 --> 00:06:00,080
Our Huo family
doesn't like to take advantage of others.

64
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,800
You have one less thing
to worry about now.

65
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,270
It's truly satisfying.

66
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,159
Of course.

67
00:06:38,870 --> 00:06:39,870
Besides,

68
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,680
he had no reason to refuse us.

69
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:44,950
So, Young Master,

70
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:47,190
what's our next plan?

71
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:56,420
[High-Society Love Scandal!]

72
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:56,390
It's time to deal with that bitch,
Fang Mulan.

73
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:59,030
[First Young Master Murong Coldly Calls Off the Engagement,
Miss Fang Leaves the Mansion in Fury]

74
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:12,070
Thank you.

75
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,430
He was so close

76
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,870
to cutting your artery.

77
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:52,720
They say Principal Murong is gentle and refined.

78
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,250
How could he be so ruthless?

79
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,120
Don't forget

80
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:58,120
that before he was a principal,

81
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:59,310
he was a 15-year-old young marshal

82
00:07:59,310 --> 00:08:01,970
of the Cheng Army
who fought on the battlefield.

83
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,630
At least he promised

84
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,000
he wouldn't kill you.

85
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,050
Help me send a telegram to Nanyang.

86
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:12,270
Also,

87
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:13,730
tell the sisters

88
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:15,560
to keep a low profile during this time

89
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,960
and protect themselves.

90
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:18,120
Okay.

91
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,950
I just saw many people outside the hotel

92
00:08:20,950 --> 00:08:22,870
scouting the area and keeping tabs on you.

93
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:23,800
I saw some of them

94
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,000
at the Huo family and the orphanage.

95
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:46,950
Because of the vault,

96
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,740
the Huo family holds a grudge against me.

97
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,720
They were only holding back
because of the Murong family.

98
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,240
Now that the engagement is broken,

99
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,360
as soon as they find an opportunity,

100
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,620
they will strike at me.

101
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,530
How dare the Huo family?

102
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,200
You are the eldest miss of the Fang family.

103
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:02,150
Murong Qingyu only needs
to tell the Huo family

104
00:09:02,150 --> 00:09:03,480
that I'm not Fang Mulan.

105
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,670
Even if he doesn't,

106
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,980
the Huo family has countless ways

107
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:11,230
to get rid of me without anyone knowing.

108
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,020
So what do we do now?

109
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:18,480
The Huo family's arms business
is their greatest source of confidence.

110
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,390
Right now,

111
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:21,190
the war in the south is critical,

112
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:23,670
but the bank is suffering
severe losses from a run.

113
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:27,130
There will inevitably be problems
with the Huo family's arms.

114
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,000
When it affects the war

115
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,970
and angers the higher-ups,

116
00:09:31,270 --> 00:09:32,200
the Huo family

117
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,240
will reach a dead end.

118
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,910
But whether it's the Fang family or the arms,

119
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:40,040
it won't solve our immediate problem.

120
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,320
Man proposes,

121
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,630
God disposes.

122
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,200
What we need to do now

123
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:47,840
is stall for time

124
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,000
and wait.

125
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,880
How do we do it?

126
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,480
Go to the hospital

127
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,130
and visit a patient.

128
00:10:00,610 --> 00:10:03,030
[Ji'an Hospital]

129
00:10:04,110 --> 00:10:07,640
[Ji'an Hospital]

130
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,960
Don't move. You still have a fever.

131
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:22,970
Where is Miss Fang?

132
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:25,270
The doctor said

133
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:27,130
you shouldn't get emotional now.

134
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,630
Stop thinking about her

135
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:30,030
and focus on recovering.

136
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:32,960
Miss Fang,

137
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,270
you can't go in!

138
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:40,360
I brought some food for Qingyi.

139
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:50,360
Worried that Qingyi might not have
an appetite while recovering,

140
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,630
I specifically went to a midnight snack stall

141
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:54,760
and bought his favorite tofu pudding.

142
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,870
The servants

143
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:02,810
can take care of these things.

144
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:11,250
You two are getting married soon.

145
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:14,000
Why are you acting like enemies?

146
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,140
We are doing great.

147
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:24,750
Mulan,

148
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,640
now that the food is here,

149
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,810
you should go back.

150
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:29,610
I will take care of Qingyi.

151
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,080
From now on,

152
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:32,870
we won't need you.

153
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,930
Have a good rest.

154
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:55,670
Miss Fang, may I

155
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:58,360
bother you, while I'm in the hospital,

156
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,760
to bring me a bowl
of tofu pudding every day?

157
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,790
Qingyi,

158
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,380
don't be childish.

159
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,630
Qingyu, you know me.

160
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,720
I'm...

161
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:12,730
afraid of bitter medicine

162
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:14,150
and painful injections.

163
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,360
If I can't eat the tofu pudding

164
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:18,360
Miss Fang brings me every day,

165
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:19,440
I'll

166
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,790
never get better.

167
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:21,480
Nonsense.

168
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,270
Then I'll buy it myself.

169
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,510
Doctor!

170
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,120
Doctor!

171
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,380
What are you doing?

172
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,510
I just brought a bowl of tofu pudding.

173
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:06,770
What are you afraid of?

174
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:14,320
You didn't tell him
about us breaking off the engagement.

175
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,780
Are you afraid
it would affect his recovery?

176
00:13:18,390 --> 00:13:19,000
Well then,

177
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:21,610
let's help him recover together.

178
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:24,200
Don't agitate him

179
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:26,040
and make him worry about me.

180
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,170
What do you want?

181
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,480
On my way to the hospital,

182
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,670
the Huo family's men
followed me all the way,

183
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:41,930
itching to make a move.

184
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:45,330
I think they'll come after me
in the next few days.

185
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,370
Send your men to protect me.

186
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,360
I need to buy 10 days.

187
00:13:52,190 --> 00:13:55,880
[Ji'an Hospital]

188
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:53,910
When that woman comes out,

189
00:13:53,910 --> 00:13:54,720
find somewhere out of sight

190
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,320
and take her away immediately.

191
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,750
It doesn't matter
if she's injured or crippled.

192
00:13:57,750 --> 00:13:59,480
Just leave her alive
for the Young Master.

193
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,210
Understood.

194
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,320
She's out.

195
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:09,200
Boss.

196
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,750
Didn't she and the Murong family
call off the engagement?

197
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:12,750
Why are they still together?

198
00:14:12,370 --> 00:14:17,840
[Ji'an Hospital]

199
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,240
Are we still going to make a move?

200
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,780
Let's wait and see.

201
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:30,550
Just 10 days.

202
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:37,360
Then I'll give you 10 days.

203
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:38,960
I will temporarily arrange for you

204
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,560
to stay at Zarry Grand Hotel.

205
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:42,970
The Cheng Army has informants there.

206
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:43,910
But remember,

207
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:45,360
everything I do

208
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,840
is just for my brother.

209
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:49,410
It has absolutely nothing to do with you.

210
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,030
If in 10 days,

211
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:53,090
you continue to pester Qingyi,

212
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:56,400
there will be no need
for the Huo family to act.

213
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,600
I will end this myself.

214
00:15:03,910 --> 00:15:04,960
It's been days.

215
00:15:04,690 --> 00:15:07,640
[Ji'an Hospital]

216
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,840
She is protected
by the Cheng Army every day.

217
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,100
We don't have a chance.

218
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,840
Cut the crap and just follow her.

219
00:15:11,710 --> 00:15:14,110
[Zarry Grand Hotel]

220
00:15:32,250 --> 00:15:35,330
[Ji'an Hospital]

221
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:47,080
What exactly happened

222
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:49,280
between you and my brother?

223
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:52,550
I told you.

224
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:54,810
We just had a little argument.

225
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:56,840
You're lying.

226
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,240
A little argument?

227
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,820
Is it necessary for Qingyu

228
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:02,730
to have so many people
watching you every day?

229
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:07,720
The most important thing for you now

230
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,000
is to rest and recover.

231
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:10,670
Qingyu and I

232
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:12,510
will handle the rest.

233
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:14,130
What about the Huo family?

234
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,810
Through Hong Fang Bank,

235
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,220
can you take them down?

236
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,240
I don't know

237
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:27,500
what agreement you reached with Qingyu,

238
00:16:28,630 --> 00:16:30,720
but since you've come to take care of me
every day,

239
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,600
you must have your own plan.

240
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,630
Let me guess.

241
00:16:38,910 --> 00:16:40,790
You want Qingyu to protect you?

242
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,670
Or...

243
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:45,390
are you trying to buy yourself time?

244
00:16:57,870 --> 00:16:59,240
Couldn't it be that

245
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,000
I just want to see you

246
00:17:07,790 --> 00:17:08,920
and take care of you?

247
00:17:15,829 --> 00:17:16,960
I hope so.

248
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:26,329
Even though I'm stuck in this ward,

249
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,200
I can guess

250
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,260
there's a storm brewing outside.

251
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,770
How long do you think Qingyu

252
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,800
can shield you from the rain?

253
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,540
Do you think you can

254
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,750
shield me from the rain?

255
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,570
A good rain comes at the right time.

256
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:07,370
If it means the clouds will part

257
00:18:08,030 --> 00:18:09,960
and the skies will clear in the end,

258
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,330
then getting drenched in a heavy downpour

259
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,310
will be worth it.

260
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:39,140
[Zarry Grand Hotel]

261
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:22,270
Has the victim's identity been confirmed?

262
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:22,790
Yes.

263
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:23,920
But...

264
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:26,300
you'd better go and see for yourself.

265
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:52,070
We received a report this morning.

266
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,200
Our men came to check

267
00:19:53,310 --> 00:19:55,030
and found it was Eldest Young Master Huo.

268
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:56,890
He was killed by a single gunshot.

269
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,110
This is a serious matter.

270
00:19:59,110 --> 00:19:59,910
Inspector Li,

271
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,600
what should we do now?

272
00:20:04,350 --> 00:20:04,950
Any clues?

273
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,030
According to the Huo family's speculation,

274
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:08,960
the killer is...

275
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:10,400
Miss Fang.

276
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:14,720
Fang Mulan?

277
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:17,660
Is there any evidence?

278
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:21,510
It's said that Young Master Huo
and Miss Fang

279
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:22,910
have been at odds lately.

280
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,510
And the crime scene

281
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:27,110
happened to be the back alley
of Zarry Grand Hotel.

282
00:20:27,110 --> 00:20:28,200
Coincidentally,

283
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:31,010
Miss Fang is staying at Zarry Grand Hotel.

284
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:42,270
Master,

285
00:20:43,070 --> 00:20:44,160
please take care of yourself.

286
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,820
It's already been confirmed.

287
00:20:46,070 --> 00:20:48,110
The police have surrounded
Zarry Grand Hotel

288
00:20:48,110 --> 00:20:50,310
to find that bitch from the Fang family.

289
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:52,680
Go.

290
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:56,030
Take that bitch here!

291
00:20:56,750 --> 00:20:58,510
I'll tear her to pieces!

292
00:20:58,680 --> 00:20:59,340
-Yes!
-Yes!

293
00:20:59,340 --> 00:20:59,830
Yes!

294
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:14,060
[Ji'an Hospital]

295
00:21:15,670 --> 00:21:19,270
[Ji'an Hospital]

296
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:45,200
Why hasn't she come
to bring me tofu pudding today?

297
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:51,720
Did anyone

298
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,030
come by this morning?

299
00:21:53,790 --> 00:21:54,310
No.

300
00:22:08,590 --> 00:22:09,750
It's been 10 days.

301
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:10,920
As agreed,

302
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:13,750
Murong Qingyu's men protecting you
have withdrawn.

303
00:22:13,750 --> 00:22:16,230
But there's still no news
from the Fang family in Nanyang.

304
00:22:16,230 --> 00:22:17,790
As for the Huo family's arms,

305
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:20,190
there's no news
of any trouble in the south.

306
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:26,270
Police.

307
00:22:26,510 --> 00:22:27,310
Open the door.

308
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:28,920
The police?

309
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:31,090
Not the Huo family?

310
00:23:25,350 --> 00:23:26,070
Go downstairs.

311
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:26,670
Chase her.

312
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,420
They are coming for me.

313
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,610
I'll lead them away.

314
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:51,530
Let's meet up at Dongjiadu.

315
00:24:02,830 --> 00:24:03,820
I'm here to change the dressing.

316
00:24:03,820 --> 00:24:08,400
[Special Care Unit]

317
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:12,880
Oh no! He's gone!

318
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:19,590
Look for him!

319
00:24:36,270 --> 00:24:36,790
Over there!

320
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:37,320
Let's go!

321
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:00,730
Don't shoot!

322
00:25:20,270 --> 00:25:21,790
Keep running.

323
00:25:31,750 --> 00:25:32,470
Miss Fang,

324
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,870
you're suspected of murder.

325
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,860
Please go to the station with me
for investigation.

326
00:25:38,030 --> 00:25:38,960
Investigation?

327
00:25:39,550 --> 00:25:40,960
Inspector Li, do you really think

328
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,420
that with Huo Zongqi dead,

329
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,750
the Huo family
will let you investigate me?

330
00:25:44,750 --> 00:25:46,210
Then how did you know that?

331
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,570
You gave yourself away.

332
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:54,360
Huo Zongqi died
near Zarry Grand Hotel.

333
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:59,990
This was deliberately planned by someone.

334
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:08,370
Someone is clearly trying to frame me.

335
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,830
If I go with you today,

336
00:26:10,270 --> 00:26:11,640
will I end up dying an unjust death

337
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:13,440
in the police station tomorrow?

338
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:15,680
You witch, you killed our Young Master,

339
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:17,160
and you still have the nerve to deny it?

340
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,590
Come back to the station with me first.

341
00:26:18,590 --> 00:26:19,240
I promise,

342
00:26:19,350 --> 00:26:20,270
before the truth comes out,

343
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:21,310
I will protect you.

344
00:26:21,310 --> 00:26:22,310
It's been 10 days.

345
00:26:22,960 --> 00:26:26,350
The investigation into the Huo family's vault
has made no progress.

346
00:26:26,350 --> 00:26:28,270
Why should I trust your promise?

347
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,000
Inspector Li,

348
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:33,590
why waste words with this witch?

349
00:26:34,310 --> 00:26:35,880
Let us take her away.

350
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,480
Our Master said

351
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,270
this bitch

352
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:42,930
must pay with her life
for killing our Young Master.

353
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:47,960
Miss Fang!

354
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,200
Freeze!

355
00:26:50,590 --> 00:26:51,520
Calm down first.

356
00:26:51,550 --> 00:26:52,880
Don't make another mistake.

357
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:54,610
Talk to me about right and wrong

358
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:57,110
after you prove the Huo family's guilt.

359
00:26:57,110 --> 00:26:57,750
Now,

360
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,310
let me go.

361
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,070
Why did you come out?

362
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,480
If getting drenched in heavy rain

363
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,880
can't bring clear skies,

364
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:55,920
what are you going to do?

365
00:28:06,270 --> 00:28:06,880
Qingyi,

366
00:28:07,350 --> 00:28:09,000
don't get involved in this for now.

367
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,070
Miss Fang is now

368
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:11,920
a murder suspect.

369
00:28:15,510 --> 00:28:16,200
Today,

370
00:28:16,830 --> 00:28:18,110
I must take her away.

371
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:23,980
Young Master Qingyi,
are you going against the Huo family?

372
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:26,090
Even Qingyu wouldn't dare do that!

373
00:28:34,490 --> 00:28:37,750
♪ Hate is the smoke left by dying flames ♪

374
00:28:38,250 --> 00:28:41,150
♪ Love is the warmth
lingering after the wildfire ♪

375
00:28:41,780 --> 00:28:45,010
♪ Love and hate collide in a blaze ♪

376
00:28:45,620 --> 00:28:49,030
♪ Devour me all ♪

377
00:28:49,050 --> 00:28:52,110
♪ Ahead lies
a tangle of joys and sorrows ♪

378
00:28:52,620 --> 00:28:55,970
♪ Behind remain
the bitterness of unspoken feelings ♪

379
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:59,700
♪ The heart races with every thought ♪

380
00:28:59,760 --> 00:29:02,840
♪ As long as we loved each other,
I don't care ♪

381
00:29:02,870 --> 00:29:07,800
♪ If it's a blessing or a curse ♪

382
00:29:09,070 --> 00:29:13,710
♪ Lies know better than my foes ♪

383
00:29:15,870 --> 00:29:21,940
♪ Resisting the pull of every temptation ♪

384
00:29:22,620 --> 00:29:25,910
♪ This spark of wildfire
spreading across the plains ♪

385
00:29:26,290 --> 00:29:29,470
♪ Stirs embers that refuse to fade ♪

386
00:29:29,870 --> 00:29:33,280
♪ I seize fate by the hand ♪

387
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:36,770
♪ Accusing it of refusing to relent ♪

388
00:29:34,070 --> 00:29:35,130
What are you doing?

389
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:40,450
♪ Pain and joy blur before my eyes ♪

390
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:39,960
Go!

391
00:29:40,670 --> 00:29:44,230
♪ Fate keeps replaying its endless cycle ♪

392
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,940
Let's go together!

393
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:43,240
Open the door!

394
00:29:44,340 --> 00:29:50,150
♪ The love that refused to die ♪

395
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:51,270
It's still raining.

396
00:29:51,270 --> 00:29:55,170
♪ Has already consumed us both ♪

397
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:55,210
Remember to bring an umbrella.

398
00:30:00,480 --> 00:30:01,070
Qingyi.

399
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:09,600
Come here.

400
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,940
You came at the right time.

401
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:17,720
After I send her away,

402
00:30:19,350 --> 00:30:20,610
I will go back with you.

403
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:22,970
She is now a murder suspect.

404
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:25,240
Our Murong family
has nothing to do with her.

405
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,680
Isn't that better?

406
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:28,800
Let her be your sister-in-law!

407
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,110
Murong Qingyi!

408
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,160
Catch her.

409
00:31:01,830 --> 00:31:02,680
For her,

410
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:06,080
you're going to kill me?

411
00:31:06,750 --> 00:31:09,150
You are the Young Marshal of the Cheng Army.

412
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:10,940
One stomp of your foot,

413
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:13,890
and the whole of Nancheng will shake.

414
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:18,030
But you refuse to let go of a woman!

415
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,070
She killed someone!

416
00:31:19,070 --> 00:31:21,200
Huo Zongqi is the real murderer!

417
00:31:42,510 --> 00:31:43,720
The vault,

418
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,080
the sin of the Huo family—

419
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:50,790
why can those people easily let it go?

420
00:31:52,110 --> 00:31:54,110
Isn't it because of some petty deals

421
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,200
and mutual interests?

422
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:58,550
Qingyu,

423
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:01,100
why do you stand by and do nothing?

424
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:03,780
Why are you in such a hurry to cut ties?

425
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:06,240
In the aviation school's motto,

426
00:32:06,270 --> 00:32:07,350
"self-examination, self-cultivation,

427
00:32:07,350 --> 00:32:09,270
serving the country,
and serving the people"—

428
00:32:09,270 --> 00:32:10,790
are they all just for show?

429
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:18,270
Or is it that,

430
00:32:19,590 --> 00:32:20,920
in your world,

431
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:24,010
the interests of the family

432
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,310
and personal honor

433
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:28,240
can override right and wrong?

434
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,270
What do you know?

435
00:32:41,550 --> 00:32:43,150
Let Boze take her away first.

436
00:32:44,030 --> 00:32:45,430
Whatever you have to say,

437
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:47,880
let's talk about it when we get back.

438
00:32:52,750 --> 00:32:53,350
Qingyi!

439
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:06,720
Qingyu.

440
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:10,200
I can't bring myself to kill you.

441
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,200
But I'm okay...

442
00:33:12,620 --> 00:33:14,590
♪ How much love ♪

443
00:33:13,510 --> 00:33:14,480
killing myself.

444
00:33:14,620 --> 00:33:17,130
♪ Is enough to be wasted? ♪

445
00:33:19,330 --> 00:33:21,190
♪ I haven't forgiven you ♪

446
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,110
Laiyi!

447
00:33:21,210 --> 00:33:23,620
♪ So don't you forgive me ♪

448
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,270
Take Miss Fang

449
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,480
back!

450
00:33:25,170 --> 00:33:28,030
♪ Let the wildfire ♪

451
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:27,590
Qingyi!

452
00:33:27,880 --> 00:33:28,350
Let's go,

453
00:33:28,060 --> 00:33:31,120
♪ Consume us and burn us to ashes ♪

454
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:28,880
Miss Fang.

455
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,510
Qingyi!

456
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,410
Let's go!

457
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:31,770
Let's go!

458
00:33:31,790 --> 00:33:34,480
♪ Still, we choose to be moths ♪

459
00:33:32,430 --> 00:33:33,110
Let's go!

460
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:34,510
Go!

461
00:33:34,500 --> 00:33:37,530
♪ Flying into the flames ♪

462
00:33:39,150 --> 00:33:40,790
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

463
00:33:40,850 --> 00:33:43,000
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

464
00:33:41,270 --> 00:33:42,070
Miss Fang!

465
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:45,710
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

466
00:33:45,730 --> 00:33:47,330
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

467
00:33:47,350 --> 00:33:49,580
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

468
00:33:50,180 --> 00:33:52,380
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

469
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:55,680
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

470
00:33:55,710 --> 00:33:58,390
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

471
00:33:59,080 --> 00:34:02,270
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

472
00:34:02,290 --> 00:34:04,940
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

473
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,090
♪ We ♪

474
00:34:06,860 --> 00:34:09,310
♪ Must be together ♪

475
00:34:09,790 --> 00:34:12,170
♪ Forevermore ♪

476
00:34:12,190 --> 00:34:13,790
♪ In exchange for my everything ♪

477
00:34:13,850 --> 00:34:15,790
♪ Will you finally be mine? ♪

478
00:34:16,429 --> 00:34:18,820
♪ Give me love and hate ♪

479
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:22,199
♪ Let the tears fall,
let the blood spill ♪

480
00:34:22,230 --> 00:34:24,889
♪ Even through suffering,
I'll never let go of your hand ♪

481
00:34:25,449 --> 00:34:28,790
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

482
00:34:28,810 --> 00:34:31,179
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

483
00:34:31,219 --> 00:34:32,550
♪ We ♪

484
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,000
Qingyi!

485
00:34:33,380 --> 00:34:35,760
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

486
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:41,280
♪ Forevermore ♪
